<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Allegra - 110,000/10 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Wilhelmshaven end Aug $7.10 fio scale load/20,000 shex Preag.</p>
<p>Exemplar - 110,000/10 tonnes coal Hampton Road/Taranto 30 July/10 Aug $6 fio 30,000 shinc/30,000 shinc Ilva.</p>
<p>Alescabalo - 55,000/10 Roberts Bank/Piombino 24/30 July $11.70 fio 6 days shinc Premuda.</p>
<p>ORE - There were no fresh ore fixtures reported on Monday.</p>
</text>
